  · exact graph212_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph213_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph214_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph215_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
