  · exact graph217_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph218_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph219_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph220_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
